{
    "name": "dsh-mattpocock-skills-deck",
    "version": "1.6.19",
    "description": "非官方 DeepSeek Harness 插件：Matt Pocock 技能套件（mattpocock/skills）的 DSH 控制面板（Deck）——将 wayfinder 地图/票务/进度、triage / grilling / handoff 动作注入带进 DSH；配套 25 个工程与效率技能。打开形式仅右侧 details 列（无 PiP/悬浮）。npm 标准安装（dsh plugin add · bundle 装配，一条命令即装好，无需手动注册）。",
    "type": "module",
    "main": "lib/index.js",
    "scripts": {
        "build": "node ../scripts/build.mjs --pkg-only",
        "prepare": "node ../scripts/build.mjs --pkg-only"
    },
    "exports": {
        ".": "./lib/index.js",
        "./client": "./lib/client.js",
        "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
        "./package.json": "./package.json"
    },
    "files": [
        "lib",
        "cordis.patch.yml"
    ],
    "keywords": [
        "dsh",
        "deepseek-harness",
        "plugin",
        "mattpocock",
        "skills",
        "wayfinder",
        "triage",
        "grilling",
        "handoff",
        "issue-tracker",
        "deck"
    ],
    "dsh": {
        "bundle": {
            "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
        },
        "client": {
            "platform": "web",
            "immediately": true,
            "inject": []
        }
    },
    "homepage": "https://github.com/FeatherHunter/dsh-mattpocock-skills-deck",
    "repository": {
        "type": "git",
        "url": "git+https://github.com/FeatherHunter/dsh-mattpocock-skills-deck.git"
    },
    "license": "MIT"
}